[{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十八","author":"张元凯","text":"圣朝臣庶洽垂裳，恸哭非时秖自伤。\n竟日天威无霁色，容城年少有封章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十九","author":"张元凯","text":"仙真异迹岂无因，海岳灵区合有人。\n夜殿焚香亲制草，诘朝分遣内台臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其二十","author":"张元凯","text":"蓬莱方丈可梯航，勾漏丹砂近寄将。\n昨铸银山高几许，试持玉尺殿中量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其二十一","author":"张元凯","text":"瑞气祥云薄海滨，远藩齐献百千春。\n进来白鹿高于马，驯扰金阶不畏人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其二十二","author":"张元凯","text":"颂美扬休锦绣香，柘黄新帕盖青箱。\n内中书法人间别，寿字能兼数字长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29415,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其二十三","author":"张元凯","text":"君王常在集灵台，正殿葳蕤锁翠苔。\n纵是明良不相见，虞廷庶事转康哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29416,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其二十四","author":"张元凯","text":"方士如云泛海槎，采真元不为丹砂。\n万金炼就壶中药，愁杀仙人萼绿华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29417,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五忆诗有序 其一 千人石明月","author":"张元凯","text":"明月青山短簿家，笙歌几处醉流霞。\n瑶光浸石翻疑水，玉露漙空尽作花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五忆诗有序 其二 文殊寺石壁","author":"张元凯","text":"朱刹孤危寄上方，青冥鹫岭独徊翔。\n云霞散落千层绮，日月昭回万仞光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五忆诗有序 其三 石湖草堂","author":"张元凯","text":"芸窗棐几绿云流，数亩琅玕一径幽。\n爱住浣花唯杜甫，常来看竹有王猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五忆诗有序 其四 虎山桥秋水","author":"张元凯","text":"石梁秋水涨平芜，髣髴潇湘入画图。\n震泽连天浮玉镜，洞庭分岫浴青凫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五忆诗有序 其五 玄墓山双桂","author":"张元凯","text":"玄亭回合众山苍，芰服初裁葛屦凉。\n双树剩能飘桂馥，九秋秖恐败兰芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客边亭四时怨 其一 春","author":"张元凯","text":"走马沙场春暮时，柳条才绿向南枝。\n弯弧莫试新开叶，留与征人赠别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29423,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客边亭四时怨 其二 夏","author":"张元凯","text":"关城榆柳乱鸣蝉，晚浴蕃儿饮马泉。\n不去平芜惊雁乳，天涯音信雁能传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29424,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客边亭四时怨 其三 秋","author":"张元凯","text":"寝甲边场泪暗流，忽看明月又逢秋。\n昔时双照深闺影，今夜孤悬绝塞愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29425,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客边亭四时怨 其四 冬","author":"张元凯","text":"陇水冰坚万骑屯，阴山雪积玉为门。\n禦寒悉是闺中力，浪说军前挟纩恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29426,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客闺中四时曲 其一 春","author":"张元凯","text":"草长花落遍关山，久客翻愁归路艰。\n遂使子规空叫月，三春不见有人还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29427,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客闺中四时曲 其二 夏","author":"张元凯","text":"为爱芙蕖水上开，漫将罗袜染芳埃。\n并头欲折何曾折，才入木兰风雨来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29428,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客闺中四时曲 其三 秋","author":"张元凯","text":"瑶琴宝瑟寂无声，只有寒螀柱下鸣。\n海月一轮通夕照，姮娥应悉此中情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29429,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客闺中四时曲 其四 冬","author":"张元凯","text":"庭树纷纷霰作花，北风吹卷入窗斜。\n天山积雪无归路，不是征人不忆家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29430,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹太史席上二咏 其一 歌","author":"张元凯","text":"红牙翠袖按清商，瞥见尘飞玳瑁梁。\n宛转尽能谐律吕，主人无忝蔡中郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹太史席上二咏 其二 舞","author":"张元凯","text":"矜娇顾影盼双蛾，尚怯当场掩袖罗。\n不赴襄王梦行雨，却随学士舞回波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇山园漫成二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"甲第名园绿水洲，茂林脩竹羽觞流。\n当年韨褉须臾事，今日兰亭坐卧游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇山园漫成二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"曲槛文漪绮席香，高台云树晚苍苍。\n分明江左东山墅，不见歌尘起杏梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携儿子允文登虎丘寺有感昔游","author":"张元凯","text":"暇日停舟绿水隈，芳菲不尽夕阳台。\n旧游零落何须问，一寺青山父子来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解嘲堂饭治兵使者幕客康从理","author":"张元凯","text":"鸡黍无能尚借人，临邛贵客岂知贫。\n穰田事事须更仆，媚灶区区太主臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"清溪瀑溜碧潺湲，猿鹤幽栖夕照间。\n采采紫芝高岭上，携筐兼得白云还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"空山樵路石嶙峋，麛鹿悠然狎隐沦。\n松下流泉清似玉，一瓢同漱颍阳人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越中阃帅席上","author":"张元凯","text":"莲花为幕玉为觞，鹦鹉留题倚鹔鹴。\n三载蒯缑萧索尽，从君拂拭吐寒光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客赴岭南幕","author":"张元凯","text":"浪说功名马伏波，少年心事在横戈。\n兹游得假楼船节，魋结先看解尉佗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日花下饮","author":"张元凯","text":"春风青鬓未成丝，放逐江湖只酒卮。\n二十年来真落魄，不曾醒眼看花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长安旧游","author":"张元凯","text":"金吾将士羽林郎，旧日交游尽老苍。\n为报吴钩贫未卖，犹堪提挈到沙场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同胡侍御昆山傅处士宅看菊","author":"张元凯","text":"坐见南山对草堂，短篱秋色一樽香。\n从知野外柴桑菊，不畏台中御史霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月望与谢都尉玄妙观赏月","author":"张元凯","text":"春城楼观列仙家，五夜杯餐五色霞。\n庾亮从来为明月，玄都不是看桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓楞伽寺二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"楞伽山寺郁楼台，湖水临窗天镜开。\n岩下疏松池上竹，清音日夕静中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓楞伽寺二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"寂寂山阿借考槃，寒云飞尽暮钟残。\n五湖秋水千林月，一片禅心此并观。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮南秋日感怀","author":"张元凯","text":"淮海清霜遍楚宫，妍华零落感伤同。\n不知客鬓今朝白，但见江枫昨夜红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿寒山寺即事","author":"张元凯","text":"江连云树路回斜，钟起寒山乱暮鸦。\n傍水花枝浑解语，东风吹入梵王家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起访曹子念","author":"张元凯","text":"惆怅朱颜镜里更，尚馀肝胆照人明。\n相逢不尽悲歌意，万里沧溟紫霓生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿弇山园水阁","author":"张元凯","text":"层楹虚阁宿流云，飞尽觥筹夜色分。\n河汉转低池水白，海天霜角醉中闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"张元凯","text":"馆娃宫畔采芳菲，相谑曾将芍药遗。\n白雪漫言人寡和，醉操银管与文姬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庭桂","author":"张元凯","text":"室如悬磬酒如泉，独酌悠然桂树边。\n重惜金茎不承露，也教离立草堂前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉湖送客","author":"张元凯","text":"八月芙蓉湖水清，征帆一片挂离情。\n暮云黯惨难为别，重唱骊驹待月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上寄远人","author":"张元凯","text":"万里相思寄楚云，三春桃李遍江濆。\n只因花里逢君别，每见花枝便忆君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题隐士壁","author":"张元凯","text":"栖息衡门有道风，落花流径水溶溶。\n空山自爱听啼鸟，人世何劳问卧龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕阳野望","author":"张元凯","text":"渔梁夕照破寒烟，一望蘼芜遍野田。\n飞尽暮禽江水阔，青山欲断白云连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧游天台","author":"张元凯","text":"乘杯已泛赤城霞，飞锡何烦碧海槎。\n经过刘郎旧时渡，莫临流水看桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寺居示弘上人","author":"张元凯","text":"浩劫终期灭累尘，去来尔汝亦何因。\n空潭秋水深千尺，照见人间未了身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"在明不赴王官之迁却寄","author":"张元凯","text":"勋业如山亦易销，况君官不过郎曹。\n纵然赋有凌云气，懒向梁园弄綵毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朗生以春社不赴约寄嘲","author":"张元凯","text":"群儿尽驾犊车轻，傀儡场中箫鼓迎。\n红杏春旗黄柳仗，家家社里醉先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"张元凯","text":"碧岭崔嵬鸟道悬，夕阳明灭白云边。\n斧斤不入山林静，鸣鹤一声闻九天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寺夜","author":"张元凯","text":"解网超然独出家，能持一戒破诸邪。\n空门八月高秋晚，皎皎青旻片月华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇山园夜雪","author":"张元凯","text":"绮阁玲珑夜有辉，却看玉树转霏微。\n主宾醉后操银管，并作瑶华散漫飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上方寺晚眺","author":"张元凯","text":"孤亭登眺夕阳间，木落秋空双鸟还。\n湖上白云飞不尽，却联红树乱青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得友人书颇及劝驾之语漫答","author":"张元凯","text":"春晖满地照悬鹑，羞说弹冠仗故人。\n雪后仅存东郭履，不堪重踏洛阳尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松陵舟次呈治兵宪使冯公","author":"张元凯","text":"花扑楼船锦缆香，兵符春暖不飞霜。\n山公一夕同樽俎，能使千秋重葛彊。","collection":"明","n